  "description": "Synthwave-inspired neon colour processing with two morphable four-stop palettes and genuine band-based horizontal image displacement. The tonal grade follows displaced source luminance, while independently offset red and blue source details produce controlled chromatic fringes. Tonal Punch and Light Shift shape the remapping; Signal Tear and Tear Height control intermittent horizontal band displacement; RGB Separation controls edge misregistration. Scanline Depth and Digital Grain add signal texture. Neon Grade and Effect Mix let the artist control colour treatment and overall intensity independently. Best on portraits, architecture, night photography, typography and contrast-rich imagery. Source alpha is preserved. Single-pass approximation: no pixel sorting, file databending, or multi-pass bloom.",
